cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use RestrictedSpinDynamics.jl in your research, please cite it."
title: "RestrictedSpinDynamics.jl"
abstract: >-
  A Julia package for restricted spin-density-matrix (SSR) simulation of open-system
  NMR spin dynamics. The density matrix is expanded in a product-operator string basis
  (Pauli strings for spin-1/2, irreducible spherical tensors for higher spin) truncated
  by correlation order (grade), the Lindblad Liouvillian is assembled as a sparse
  superoperator, and it is propagated matrix-free with Krylov expv, reaching multi-spin
  ensembles (superradiance/RASER, SABRE, ZULF, INEPT) that are infeasible in full
  Liouville space.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Seth
    family-names: Dilday
    email: sadilday@ncsu.edu
version: "0.9.0"
date-released: "2026-09-29"
license: MIT
